---
title: Light Olive Garden Salad Dressing
author: Amee's Savory Dish
source: https://ameessavorydish.com/copycat-olive-garden-salad/
prep time: 5 minutes
total time: 5 minutes
tags:
  - dressing
  - salad
  - vegetarian
servings: 12
---

Combine @avocado oil mayonnaise{0.25%cup} (or an olive oil blend mayonnaise), @extra-virgin olive oil{0.25%cup} (or extra-light olive oil for a milder flavor), @sugar{1%Tbsp}, @white wine vinegar{1/3%cup} (or white vinegar), @fresh lemon juice{1%Tbsp}, shredded @Parmesan-Romano cheese blend{4%Tbsp}, @garlic salt{0.25%tsp}, @Italian seasoning{0.5%tsp}, @dried parsley{0.5%tsp}, and @fresh cracked black pepper{to taste} in a #blender{} and blend until smooth.

Pour desired amount over salad, toss, and serve immediately. Store leftover dressing in an airtight container in the #refrigerator{} for up to 1 week.
